# Think before code

Consequential work: **`briefing-and-planning`** (hand-off) and **`think-before-ship`** (design note, size skip/medium/large) before code. Formal: **`formal-verification-starter`** only if checklist passes. Install: [docs/THINKING_SKILLS_INSTALL.md](../../docs/THINKING_SKILLS_INSTALL.md), pstack [docs/PSTACK.md](../../docs/PSTACK.md).

Skills (not long rules):

| Need | Skill |
|------|--------|
| Design note, interrogate, statechart | `think-before-ship` |
| Glossary, feature map, ADRs, layout | `product-architecture-context` |
| TLA+ / Lean when warranted | `formal-verification-starter` |
| Lint, ratchet, local check | `quality-pack` + `./scripts/check.sh` |

Do not add prose that duplicates pstack or linters. Corrections become code: `deterministic-quality.mdc`.